## 7️⃣ TL;DR code snippet (copy‑paste)

```js
// Register custom protocol (v4)
maplibregl.addProtocol('mytiles', async (params, abortSignal) => {
  const url = params.url.replace('mytiles://', 'https://my.tileserver.com/tiles/') + '.pbf';

  const resp = await fetch(url, { signal: abortSignal });
  if (!resp.ok) return null;               // no tile

  const buf = await resp.arrayBuffer();
  return { data: buf };
});

